Hi Jennifer,

I'd like to discuss an observation of our night count. Could you follow six n=
ight-shift staff and explain on September 26 which bin they return to after a=
nother task interrupts the count? I'd like us to confirm that scope today.

I've attached the day count desk instructions for comparison. On days the fix=
ed reconciliation clerk handles the sheet at the desk. At night we don't have=
 that role: the person doing the count reconciles and saves it, leaves the bi=
n when called away, and has to return to the reconciliation themselves. Pleas=
e bear that difference in mind when planning the visits; the desk route in th=
e attachment isn't the night procedure.

Thanks,
Ronald

